    "type": "game",
    "name": "Cryptid Engine",
    "steam_appid": 3638830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move slowly. Look closely. In this world, the silence speaks, and what hides in the stillness is watching you too.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no puzzles, jump scares, or goals.. there's only you... and your camera. Only the most patient are able to hunt down the ethereal beings of the other world(s).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by old computer hunting games... players can earn points upon successfully capturing a creature on camera. And spend those points on more dangerous maps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Level Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels are &quot;assembled&quot; using the in-house game engine created in Raylib.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experienced players are able to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use any model they want for the &quot;<strong>creature_model&quot; </strong>and the &quot;<i><strong>env_model</strong></i>&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign an unlock price for their maps (maximum: 1000 pts)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the behavior of creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the texture/sound/model for almost any visual asset used in a map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses morph keys for variety. No advanced knowledge of modeling topics required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638830/extras/e3196beafe44c68749cf14bc40beb409.avif?t=1750467235\" width=800 height=796 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move slowly. Look closely. In this world, the silence speaks, and what hides in the stillness is watching you too.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no puzzles, jump scares, or goals.. there's only you... and your camera. Only the most patient are able to hunt down the ethereal beings of the other world(s).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by old computer hunting games... players can earn points upon successfully capturing a creature on camera. And spend those points on more dangerous maps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Level Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All levels are &quot;assembled&quot; using the in-house game engine created in Raylib.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experienced players are able to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use any model they want for the &quot;<strong>creature_model&quot; </strong>and the &quot;<i><strong>env_model</strong></i>&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign an unlock price for their maps (maximum: 1000 pts)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the behavior of creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the texture/sound/model for almost any visual asset used in a map.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses morph keys for variety. No advanced knowledge of modeling topics required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638830/extras/e3196beafe44c68749cf14bc40beb409.avif?t=1750467235\" width=800 height=796 /></span></p>",
